WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.237
- We will be judging everything based off

00:00:02.237 --> 00:00:03.700
their OWL equivalency level.

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:06.852
(gentle music)

00:00:18.014 --> 00:00:20.011
- Harry Potter is everything.

00:00:20.011 --> 00:00:21.312
- He's my one true love.

00:00:21.312 --> 00:00:22.681
- Harry Potter's so much more than just

00:00:22.681 --> 00:00:25.294
a cool thing, it's just

00:00:25.294 --> 00:00:27.609
a way of life.

00:00:30.216 --> 00:00:31.632
- Are they supposed to be frogs?

00:00:31.632 --> 00:00:33.234
They're almost frogs.

00:00:33.234 --> 00:00:35.754
- Please tell me these
aren't actually cockroaches.

00:00:35.754 --> 00:00:37.054
- I mean, I'm into it.

00:00:37.054 --> 00:00:39.495
- I'm gonna get the most
cockroach looking one.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.366
- It's fudgey, it's sweet.

00:00:43.366 --> 00:00:44.841
- It's like two different
types of chocolate

00:00:44.841 --> 00:00:45.862
or is that caramel?

00:00:45.862 --> 00:00:47.279
- Wizarding world's version of a turtle.

00:00:47.279 --> 00:00:48.985
- If real cockroaches tasted like this,

00:00:48.985 --> 00:00:51.952
I could live off cockroaches.

00:00:55.324 --> 00:00:56.520
- The (beep) is this?

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:58.180
- This is not a chocolate frog.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:00:59.665
- This is pretty thick.

00:00:59.665 --> 00:01:01.280
- Well, who do you think
would be eating this?

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:02.846
- Hufflepuffs, to be honest.

00:01:02.846 --> 00:01:04.646
- Oh, God, here it goes.

00:01:04.646 --> 00:01:06.143
- It's good.

00:01:06.143 --> 00:01:07.456
- It's so much sugar.

00:01:07.456 --> 00:01:09.720
- It's like slimy, but sweet slimy.

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:10.903
- If I had a spoon,

00:01:10.903 --> 00:01:12.878
(laughs) this would be a good dessert.

00:01:12.878 --> 00:01:16.076
- It looks like a muggle
but tastes like magic.

00:01:18.357 --> 00:01:21.016
- Chocolate frog's ugly
cousin, peppermint toads.

00:01:21.016 --> 00:01:22.641
- Everything in the Wizarding world so far

00:01:22.641 --> 00:01:24.626
has been very mushy (laughs).

00:01:24.626 --> 00:01:26.321
- Oh my God, it smells really minty.

00:01:26.321 --> 00:01:29.073
- It's really sweet and really

00:01:29.073 --> 00:01:30.914
thick.
- [Man] It's gross.

00:01:30.914 --> 00:01:33.051
- This is (beep) weird.

00:01:33.051 --> 00:01:34.967
This tastes like toothpaste.

00:01:34.967 --> 00:01:36.173
- It's basically the peppermint filling

00:01:36.173 --> 00:01:37.289
from a peppermint patty.

00:01:37.289 --> 00:01:39.343
- I love the frog, but--

00:01:39.343 --> 00:01:41.932
- Yeah, it's cute to look at.
- [Man] It is dense.

00:01:41.932 --> 00:01:44.951
- First year at Hogwarts,
I'm eating these all day.

00:01:47.321 --> 00:01:52.067
- (gasps) Droobles Best
Blowing Bubblegum. Cool!

00:01:52.067 --> 00:01:54.353
- It's a little stickier than a gumball.

00:01:54.353 --> 00:01:56.409
- It's so chewy. Why?

00:01:56.409 --> 00:01:58.765
- It tastes like we're chewing on gum

00:01:58.765 --> 00:02:00.089
that someone already chewed on.

00:02:00.089 --> 00:02:03.455
- I actually kind of like this
harder, thicker gum texture.

00:02:03.455 --> 00:02:05.173
- There's not much of a flavor,

00:02:05.173 --> 00:02:06.706
so I guess that would last all day.

00:02:06.706 --> 00:02:09.330
- Mmm, blueberry, uh--

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:10.604
- Grape?
- [Man] Magic.

00:02:10.604 --> 00:02:12.624
- It does lose its flavor really quickly.

00:02:12.624 --> 00:02:13.855
- Yeah, it's gone.

00:02:13.855 --> 00:02:16.182
I can feel the flavor just
dripping into my throat.

00:02:18.416 --> 00:02:19.566
- It's not a bubble.

00:02:19.566 --> 00:02:20.750
- That's the first bubble I've ever blown!

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:23.374
(chuckles)

00:02:23.374 --> 00:02:26.169
- That was awesome.

00:02:27.228 --> 00:02:29.570
- You can make candies taste like you read

00:02:29.570 --> 00:02:32.170
in the books, but you
can't make 'em magic.

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:34.713
- Any chance to bring the HP world to life

00:02:34.713 --> 00:02:36.152
is okay by me.

00:02:36.152 --> 00:02:37.719
- I think I've just gotten an idea for

00:02:37.719 --> 00:02:41.359
next date night with my wife.

00:02:44.836 --> 00:02:47.369
Except I'm definitely gonna
make a chocolate frog.

